## What "done" looks like (the global exit condition)

All of the following must be true before you create `ralph/STOP` for completion:

- `{{BUILD_AND_TEST_COMMAND}}` is green from a clean clone.
- `{{LOCAL_RUN_COMMAND}}` boots all local dependencies (skip if not applicable).
- The integration test suite passes.
- The end-to-end smoke test described in `ralph/SPEC.md` works.
- `README.md` at repo root documents how to run the project and the tests.

When all that holds, write `ralph/STOP` and we're done.

